# GitHub is the remote of record

- `origin` is `https://github.com/ombhatt/novaai-subscriptions.git`. Push, pull, and set upstreams there.
- The Cursor Origin remote is `cursor` (`origin.cursor.com`). Do not push to it, create Origin PRs, or run `origin pr` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Open and merge pull requests with `gh` against `ombhatt/novaai-subscriptions`.
- CI that matters for merge is GitHub Actions (`lint`, `test`, `audit`). Depot / `.depot/workflows` is Origin-only leftover.
- Do not rewrite remotes or delete the Origin repo unless the user asks.
